        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "height": 238,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWOe1NZWEAANIr9.png?name=small",
            "width": 1056
          }
        ],
        "name": "Texas Twins Dad",
        "text": "New Grok Bot feature I just discovered on a call. My bot called my car insurance today to ask why my renewal went up 14% with zero accidents. Mid-call, the rep asked a question.\n\nThe bot didn't hang up. It didn't make me take over the call. A question card popped up in my chat. I typed the answer, and the bot kept the call going on its own.\n\nIt's like passing a note to my assistant while they're still on the phone.\n\nGrok Bot is like hiring my personal assistant!",
        "url": "https://x.com/Texas_Twins_Dad/status/2117723394330460528",
        "verified": true,
