        "name": "DogeDesigner",
        "text": "BREAKING: The Government of Canada’s Starlink contract has grown to nearly C$29 million, more than 12 times its original value. 🇨🇦\n\nOfficial government records show:\n\n• Original contract value: C$2.26 million\n• Updated total value: C$28.95 million\n• Increase: approximately C$26.7 million \n\nThe agreement with SpaceX Canada provides Starlink satellite connectivity for Shared Services Canada and its partner government organizations as needed.\n\nThe contract could continue until 2029, according to the Investigative Journalism Foundation. \n\nStarlink continues to support the communications needs of Canada’s federal government.",
