      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "Shopping is the most underrated agent use case.\n\nEveryone demos coding, but the pain most people actually have every week is 12 tabs of the same fucking air fryer and \"where's my package?\" lol.\n\nGrok Bot does that part now:\n> finds the best deal\n> compares items side by side\n> tracks all your orders in one place\n\nGive it a spin and lmk what you want next.",
      "quote": {
        "author": "bot",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2087219239275069440/KW6C403V_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-04 05:50:42",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-11-03T21:50:42.000Z",
        "id": "2117736249444507834",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2117735046065070080/img/SdipeDltihzi-7WJ.jpg"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "duration": 16.733,
            "height": 1080,
            "thumbnail_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2117735046065070080/img/SdipeDltihzi-7WJ.jpg",
            "type": "video",
            "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2117735046065070080/vid/avc1/1920x1080/vzWGF2LuTlVA_3RB.mp4?tag=29",
            "width": 1920
          }
        ],
        "name": "Grok Bot",
        "text": "Try the new shopping experience in Grok Bot.\n\nFind the best deal, compare items, and have Bot track all your orders.",
        "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2117736249444507834",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "organization"
      },
      "retweet": {
        "author": "larsencc",
