      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "BREAKING: Norway’s government secures @Starlink access for its military, police and security agencies under a satellite communications deal worth up to NOK 450 million. 🇳🇴\n\nThe agreement covers:\n• Norwegian Armed Forces\n• Police\n• Police Security Service (PST)\n• National Security Authority (NSM)\n\nNorway’s military already has 180 active Starlink subscriptions for email, internet access and personnel welfare.\n\nAwarded to Marlink, a Norway-based satellite communications provider, the agreement includes several satellite networks and specifically requires access to Starlink.",
      "quote": null,
